# A local slide template that lives in inst/extdata beside the tracked
# hv_ppt_template.pptx but is not a package asset. Already .Rbuildignore-d
# (line 47) so it never reached a tarball, but nothing kept it out of git and
# a git add -A swept it into an unrelated commit. Named rather than globbed:
# hv_ppt_template.pptx in the same directory IS tracked, and a *.pptx rule
# would leave it ignored-but-tracked.
inst/extdata/Yahoo slide template LIGHT ROOM.pptx
